sequenceDiagram
    actor Client
    participant API
    participant PostgreSQL
    participant Worker
    participant RabbitMQ

    Client->>API: POST /orders
    API->>API: Create Order and OutboxMessage
    API->>PostgreSQL: Save Order and OutboxMessage
    Note over API,PostgreSQL: Single database transaction
    PostgreSQL-->>API: Commit
    API-->>Client: 201 Created

    loop Polling cycle
        Worker->>PostgreSQL: Query pending OutboxMessages
        PostgreSQL-->>Worker: Pending messages
    end
    Worker->>RabbitMQ: Publish order.created
    RabbitMQ-->>Worker: Publish completed
    Worker->>PostgreSQL: Set ProcessedAtUtc
    PostgreSQL-->>Worker: Update committed
